      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\",\"(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\",\"(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:3381568aa0d14c998a2fc7c5d20caaef3f2a165d9d9f94260ed1f509a86f5a65\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:e60b7e72fd3c276f0597cb659041a790ba24061e4abb9a00c999e7dfb93b4a5b\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:490d8b81ca82c2084d18b78abc568f8b55bf8a546df25cb16d86ca2413b06e47\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:b431e38dd73e90a85f2cb4f6f6f65ad8b6335754afa73403959bc580dbf5c020\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:5af277ae2a6e7e0c117b780636999b043c8f52ac9a4525f7944fa40c0f18bbe0\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:e3ba77a9354dfd05b333639121bcf158eecf1f3cb3a83618818db1bc6bc6e26d\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:0406c254a4e3eaab8109c05d1002daecc3bb95b4c56081c95216146c6167d9a0\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:23da9759ce716f9cf193efe566db9ccba4d6cea475ca9a1878d97a049a76c518\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:296944b372fadd5a85e97d9d5ee4bd9a2babe577187722743aa328ee9597805d\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"choice_text\":\"When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter; or when the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or when the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":769,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:85:769:sha256-f0b5b25a137f7cce76590536680b771afaf6acb0a5936dc368649100eb2ba93d\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":85},{\"end\":608,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:548:608:sha256-c139a639c1d605a7d307ad6a66eb81168e6c66c3a021b60c289053565aaa41c2\",\"quote\":\"(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\",\"start\":548},{\"end\":226,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:219:226:sha256-0007a8bea4dcd3f6b1490fc7199650f1046713dd92d9314e1f2ede6946fcd999\",\"quote\":\"may not\",\"start\":219},{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:85:769:sha256-f0b5b25a137f7cce76590536680b771afaf6acb0a5936dc368649100eb2ba93d\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":85},{\"end\":327,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:85:327:sha256-a32c8dfb7196d8707007190b60d5fd2a41cfc2faf3efbb1eecb19d61e6401457\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\",\"start\":85},{\"end\":546,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:329:546:sha256-d5fe1a750d86ba4e476f3b755b0d6c324a6a6e30d69b292a6b13efb667ae044b\",\"quote\":\"(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\",\"start\":329},{\"end\":608,\"field\":\"alternative:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:548:608:sha256-c139a639c1d605a7d307ad6a66eb81168e6c66c3a021b60c289053565aaa41c2\",\"quote\":\"(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\",\"start\":548},{\"end\":769,\"field\":\"alternative:2\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:610:769:sha256-3303604764789bed72f78d4739f5fe14e317e2fcc6c61bed6be2c6efd864dead\",\"quote\":\"(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"start\":610}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:ccd8a4a97f8b526e5be477416286aff69352e5026ddb6ba9f82dc3afd9b9bdb6\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"prohibition\",\"logic_text\":\"(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:296944b372fadd5a85e97d9d5ee4bd9a2babe577187722743aa328ee9597805d\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"modality_quote\":\"may not\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:c11c7d944b82b5a8da3aa4d20995343344eba72d349e7f162f955d8a272ff8e3\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\\n\\n(1) When performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area, or before boarding an aircraft for which screening is conducted under this subchapter;\\n\\n(2) When the individual is entering or in a sterile area; or\\n\\n(3) When the individual is attempting to board or onboard an aircraft for which screening is conducted under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"references\":[\"paragraph (b)\",\"§§ 1544.201\",\"1546.201\",\"1562.23\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:6477eed777679ff5b578e2ee4cf16463cd9a2b41a06ebd0c6be4a36d6b4f015d\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(a) On an individual's person or accessible property—prohibitions. Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property—\"],\"scope_text\":\"Except as provided in paragraph (b) of 49 CFR 1540.111.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":85,\"summary\":\"Except as provided in paragraph (b) of this section, an individual may not have a weapon, explosive, or incendiary, on or about the individual's person or accessible property when performance has begun of the inspection of the individual's person or accessible property before entering a sterile area or before boarding a screened aircraft, when entering or in a sterile area, or when attempting to board or onboard an aircraft screened under §§ 1544.201, 1546.201, or 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
