      "dcterms:format": "application/json",
      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\",\"(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\",\"(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:ab4d54a384c1a918db40a75cc734463f63d7194e8f8df72158317c68fe15ae66\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:5ba3f4dad67fbfc41ce3fddf47e4ce5ce10bbbebe5c94acd1150dd47ee1c45cd\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:54f0eec1cea46d56f3ea3bfe63aaf982905d8d9c352cc8978d8bcac64cdbf0a9\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:2d6c0b472942ebd07efa31a89e6bb16990840946e1aa2971da0f9b1e15b91119\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:4e77680d6388f58d73813761074e184d97c8bba664ec2da4ac5fd4d23f7a11a6\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:b57f133adc54ac925be4dc16c0d22dad695f4194978a7c069ab176bab6983667\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:5010fa6062009511a9c7c99f5ec47994ab4dfec436c2da27ab6c0fd854495556\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:440b93470aab9aaf1dcfeb93c68dddb4ed59112808b883b5fe0d0b307258ebb7\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:53eff6bf8e5e0bc52d5a79ef72377370ba1e0ee4fcbe10aaa02f9434999d2a32\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"choice_text\":\"The individual is one of the following: (1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport; (2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter; or (3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":1374,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:1374:sha256-af1a8c92b280b982ac594e1fcc08434ad2ae0eee06bd57850e156e234140fad1\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":988,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:988:sha256-9b176610a451fc252606e5feec7a890a0e3330de336680f39d2efb15eb504cc3\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":900,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:886:900:sha256-533232681eac9dd2c357af3b24908d4c4e8d41562c911ad7ed51eb0f4638ccd0\",\"quote\":\"does not apply\",\"start\":886},{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:1374:sha256-af1a8c92b280b982ac594e1fcc08434ad2ae0eee06bd57850e156e234140fad1\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":988,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:771:988:sha256-9b176610a451fc252606e5feec7a890a0e3330de336680f39d2efb15eb504cc3\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\",\"start\":771},{\"end\":1129,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:990:1129:sha256-f63ba4358ff966ac514283f276f0c32e86dfc525ab2beea862985bb4ee9e53da\",\"quote\":\"(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\",\"start\":990},{\"end\":1282,\"field\":\"alternative:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1131:1282:sha256-9ab3e271d6219176b18a908e1e89635a5cbfeb67fd6a395dd3bcf59d3ad942c1\",\"quote\":\"(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\",\"start\":1131},{\"end\":1374,\"field\":\"alternative:2\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aab45ff8a7d213a548ba64b9bd9efdd9202dcd2f94cc0c1045a1b5fb69fe86460:1284:1374:sha256-767b73a5ca31a741e65fb7e179b443fe99e4fac4dbe40a0ca0c7e7df93cee56a\",\"quote\":\"(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"start\":1284}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:324d41f7ea6f3b27c43c46082c941143f1fad2a9fc4346cf5e0d2c6fe3af0f4b\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"exemption\",\"logic_text\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:53eff6bf8e5e0bc52d5a79ef72377370ba1e0ee4fcbe10aaa02f9434999d2a32\",\"modality\":\"not_required\",\"modality_quote\":\"does not apply\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:cda30bb1286ffcf53d776fe7bb29511168c4623b0c2bf0050847471f163c07c8\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\\n\\n(1) Law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while in the performance of law enforcement duty at the airport.\\n\\n(2) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter.\\n\\n(3) An individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"references\":[\"Paragraph (a)\",\"§§ 1544.219\",\"1544.221\",\"1544.223\",\"1546.211\",\"subpart B of part 1562\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:5232eea1d9c7d3cff164a22a7aee971ffc463cba8b5a662d54e52257c2c1d181\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(b) On an individual's person or accessible property—permitted carriage of a weapon. Paragraph (a) of this section does not apply as to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is one of the following:\"],\"scope_text\":\"As to carriage of firearms and other weapons on an individual's person or accessible property.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":771,\"summary\":\"Paragraph (a) of 49 CFR 1540.111 does not apply to carriage of firearms and other weapons if the individual is law enforcement personnel required to carry a firearm or other weapons while performing law enforcement duty at the airport, an individual authorized to carry a weapon in accordance with §§ 1544.219, 1544.221, 1544.223, 1546.211, or subpart B of part 1562 of this chapter, or an individual authorized to carry a weapon in a sterile area under a security program.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
